:: Dad Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> walk side by side, him happily waiting for whatever sort of adventure or game you will be doing next. Despite not having that much fun yet, you can tell he is still excited for what’s to come and for more chances to hang out with you. <span style="color:LightCoral">That makes the next part all the worse as you turn to him and say that it was time for you two to separate for now. He turns to you with a surprised look, disappointment briefly flashing across his face.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
