<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Time to-?”</span> He pauses, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, haha, alright then. I guess you do probably want to run off and hang out without your old man holding you back. That’s fine. This was nice, but I should be getting home anyway. Have- have fun! Don’t be out too late… okay?”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">You feel extremely guilty for having invited <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Dad</span> out to hang out, only to provide a very boring time. You hope he isn’t too disappointed.</span> <br>
